Vulnerability data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

opencraysec downloads public vulnerability data at run time (OSV and the advisory databases
it aggregates, the CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities catalog, FIRST EPSS scores, the
MITRE CWE catalog and NVD records). That data is not part of this software and stays under
the terms of its publishers; see docs/DATA-SOURCES.md.
